    "source_semantics": "createSessionBySig hashes every ordered AssetLimit(token,limit), hashes the exact Session type, applies the deployment EIP-712 domain, verifies the owner signature, then stores the exact session after enforcing nonzero owner/delegate, validity, call-cap, fee-cap, and unique nonzero-token constraints.",
